<h2>Asobi 1.0 (build 994)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>"Request the Mac app" reaches you.</b> When a reviewer on the web page asks for the Mac app, the request (name, email, studio, note) lands in the review's row in Past Reviews under <i>Asked for the Mac app</i>, and in the studio watcher's daily record.</li>
</ul>
